```

No `debug_panel_open` bool needed — the existing `AppMode` / `mode_stack` handles screen switching via `push_mode(AppMode::DebugLog)` / `pop_mode()`.

### 7. Integration with existing Banner

The Banner system (`set_error`/`set_success`) continues to work as-is for explicit user-facing messages from handlers. The log buffer is a separate channel for tracing output:

- `set_error("Invalid card title")` → Banner (user action feedback, auto-clears 3s)
