- Root epic: **KAN-821**. Owning sub-epic: **KAN-823 (SE-B — archived-cards first-class retrofit)**.
- Implements DECIDED **D2** (archived cards are a first-class discrete peer collection carrying their own `board_id`, never duplicated inside `cards`) and DECIDED **D7** (proper migration with backup + round-trip data-preserving test) on the JSON backend.
