## Where, Why, How

**Where.** Every CLI handler that takes string identifiers (board name, column name, card identifier, sprint identifier) opens with the same 4-line `match resolve_X { Ok => ..., Err => return output_error }` pattern. ~25 occurrences across `crates/kanban-cli/src/handlers/`:

