1. Confirm card 6.1 (KanbanBackend trait redefinition) merged (or land together).
2. Replace the existing `impl KanbanBackend for SqliteBackend` block with the two blocks above.
3. The error-mapping pattern uses the `From<KanbanError> for CoreError` impl added in the Scaffolding section.
4. `cargo build -p kanban-service --features sqlite`.

