# SQLite migration: add id + timestamp columns to commands table

## Motivation
SqliteBackend stores commands in a `commands` table. Migrating to CommandRecord requires (a) an impl rewrite and (b) a numbered SQL migration that adds `id TEXT` and `timestamp TEXT` columns, backfilling existing rows.

## Current state
